<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>LAN CONNECT — Jaringan Komputer</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #05070d;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ================= SIDEBAR ================= */

        .sidebar {
            position: fixed;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 250px;
            height: 100vh;
            background: #070b14;
            border-right: 1px solid #008cff;
            padding: 25px 18px;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 140, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .logo h2 {
            color: #00aaff;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 12px #008cff;
        }

        .logo p {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #777;
        }

        .menu a {
            display: block;
            color: #bbb;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 13px 15px;
            margin: 7px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .menu a:hover {
            background: #008cff;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #008cff;
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        /* ================= MAIN ================= */

        .main {
            margin-left: 250px;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        /* ================= HERO ================= */

        .hero {
            min-height: 450px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 60px;
            border: 1px solid #006eff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(0, 132, 255, .22), transparent 35%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #060a13, #02050b);
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 119, 255, .15);
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 174, 255, .25);
            border-radius: 50%;
            right: -100px;
            top: -100px;
            animation: rotate 15s linear infinite;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 750px;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .tag {
            color: #00aaff;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 75px);
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 153, 255, .7);
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #00aaff;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: #aaa;
            max-width: 650px;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 13px 25px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #008cff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 140, 255, .5);
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px #008cff;
        }

        /* ================= IDENTITY ================= */

        .identity {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .identity-card {
            background: #090e18;
            border: 1px solid #12385b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .identity-card:hover {
            border-color: #00aaff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 153, 255, .2);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }

        .identity-card small {
            color: #777;
        }

        .identity-card h3 {
            color: #00aaff;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        /* ================= SECTION ================= */

        section {
            margin-top: 70px;
            scroll-margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .section-title {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #00aaff;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #777;
        }

        /* ================= CARDS ================= */

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #090e18;
            border: 1px solid #153b61;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            transition: .3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: #008cff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 140, 255, .15);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #00aaff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .card p,
        .card li {
            color: #bbb;
        }

        ul,
        ol {
            padding-left: 22px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* ================= TABLE ================= */

        .table-container {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: #090e18;
        }

        th,
        td {
            padding: 14px;
            border: 1px solid #16466e;
            text-align: center;
        }

        th {
            background: #0077cc;
            color: white;
        }

        td {
            color: #ccc;
        }

        /* ================= STEP ================= */

        .steps {
            counter-reset: step;
        }

        .step {
            display: flex;
            gap: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: #090e18;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 3px solid #008cff;
        }

        .step-number {
            min-width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #008cff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #008cff;
        }

        /* ================= MEDIA ================= */

        .media-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .media-card {
            background: #090e18;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #153b61;
        }

        .media-card h3 {
            color: #00aaff;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        video {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: black;
            border: 1px solid #006eff;
        }

        .ppt-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 500px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #006eff;
            background: #000;
        }

        .ppt-container iframe {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
        }

        /* ================= TERMINAL ================= */

        .terminal {
            background: #02050a;
            border: 1px solid #0077cc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-family: Consolas, monospace;
            color: #00eaff;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .terminal span {
            color: #6f8195;
        }

        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */

        footer {
            margin-top: 80px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #12385b;
            color: #777;
        }

        footer strong {
            color: #00aaff;
        }

        /* ================= ANIMATION ================= */

        @keyframes rotate {
            from {
                transform: rotate(0deg);
            }

            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        .glow {
            animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes glow {
            from {
                text-shadow: 0 0 5px #008cff;
            }

            to {
                text-shadow: 0 0 25px #008cff;
            }
        }

        /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */

        @media(max-width: 900px) {

            .sidebar {
                position: relative;
                width: 100%;
                height: auto;
                border-right: none;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #008cff;
            }

            .main {
                margin-left: 0;
            }

            .identity,
            .grid,
            .media-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {

            .main {
                padding: 15px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 30px;
            }

            .identity,
            .grid,
            .media-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 45px;
            }

            .ppt-container {
                height: 350px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- ================= SIDEBAR ================= -->

    <aside class="sidebar">

        <div class="logo">
            <h2>LAN CONNECT</h2>
            <p>NETWORK PROJECT</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="menu">

            <a href="#home">⌂ Dashboard</a>

            <a href="#materi">▣ Materi</a>

            <a href="#straight-cross">▣ Straight & Cross</a>

            <a href="#merangkai">⚡ Merangkai LAN</a>

            <a href="#sharing">⇄ Sharing Data</a>

            <a href="#ppt">▤ Preview PPT</a>

            <a href="#video">▶ Video Tutorial</a>

        </nav>

    </aside>


    <!-- ================= MAIN ================= -->

    <main class="main">

        <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

        <section id="home">

            <div class="hero">

                <div class="hero-content">

                    <div class="tag">JARINGAN KOMPUTER • 2026</div>

                    <h1>
                        LAN <span>CONNECT</span>
                    </h1>

                    <p>
                        Media pembelajaran interaktif mengenai
                        perakitan kabel LAN tipe Straight-Through dan
                        Cross-Over serta sharing data menggunakan
                        jaringan Peer-to-Peer.
                    </p>

                    <a href="#materi" class="btn">
                        Mulai Belajar →
                    </a>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- ================= IDENTITY ================= -->

        <div class="identity">

            <div class="identity-card">
                <small>NAMA</small>
                <h3>Ismail Zen</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="identity-card">
                <small>NIM</small>
                <h3>62640723222</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="identity-card">
                <small>KELAS</small>
                <h3>1TIB</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="identity-card">
                <small>MATA KULIAH</small>
                <h3>Jaringan Komputer</h3>
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- ================= MATERI ================= -->

        <section id="materi">

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>01. Dasar Kabel LAN</h2>

                <p>
                    Mengenal fungsi, jenis dan penggunaan kabel LAN.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="grid">

                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Pengertian Kabel LAN</h3>

                    <p>
                        Kabel LAN atau Local Area Network merupakan
                        media transmisi yang digunakan untuk
                        menghubungkan perangkat jaringan seperti
                        komputer, laptop, switch dan router.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Fungsi Kabel LAN</h3>

                    <ul>

                        <li>Menghubungkan dua atau lebih perangkat.</li>

                        <li>Mentransmisikan data melalui jaringan.</li>

                        <li>Membentuk jaringan lokal.</li>

                        <li>Mendukung komunikasi antar komputer.</li>

                        <li>Dapat digunakan untuk sharing data.</li>

                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- ================= STRAIGHT CROSS ================= -->

        <section id="straight-cross">

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>02. Straight-Through & Cross-Over</h2>

                <p>
                    Perbedaan susunan warna kabel dan penggunaannya.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="table-container">

                <table>

                    <tr>

                        <th>Jenis Kabel</th>

                        <th>Susunan</th>

                        <th>Penggunaan</th>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Straight-Through</td>

                        <td>T568B ↔ T568B</td>

                        <td>Komputer → Switch</td>

                    </tr>

                    <tr>

                        <td>Cross-Over</td>

                        <td>T568A ↔ T568B</td>

                        <td>Komputer → Komputer</td>

                    </tr>

                </table>

            </div>


            <br>


            <div class="grid">

                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Susunan T568B</h3>

                    <ol>

                        <li>Putih Orange</li>

                        <li>Orange</li>

                        <li>Putih Hijau</li>

                        <li>Biru</li>

                        <li>Putih Biru</li>

                        <li>Hijau</li>

                        <li>Putih Cokelat</li>

                        <li>Cokelat</li>

                    </ol>

                </div>


                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Susunan T568A</h3>

                    <ol>

                        <li>Putih Hijau</li>

                        <li>Hijau</li>

                        <li>Putih Orange</li>

                        <li>Biru</li>

                        <li>Putih Biru</li>

                        <li>Orange</li>

                        <li>Putih Cokelat</li>

                        <li>Cokelat</li>

                    </ol>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- ================= ALAT ================= -->

        <section>

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>03. Alat & Bahan</h2>

                <p>
                    Peralatan yang diperlukan untuk membuat kabel LAN.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="grid">

                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Alat</h3>

                    <ul>

                        <li>Tang Crimping</li>

                        <li>LAN Cable Tester</li>

                        <li>Gunting atau pemotong kabel</li>

                        <li>Laptop / PC</li>

                    </ul>

                </div>


                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Bahan</h3>

                    <ul>

                        <li>Kabel UTP</li>

                        <li>Konektor RJ45</li>

                        <li>Boot RJ45 (opsional)</li>

                    </ul>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- ================= MERANGKAI ================= -->

        <section id="merangkai">

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>04. Cara Merangkai Kabel LAN</h2>

                <p>
                    Langkah pembuatan kabel LAN dari awal hingga pengujian.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="steps">

                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">1</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Potong Kabel UTP</h3>

                        <p>
                            Potong kabel UTP sesuai panjang yang diperlukan.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">2</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Kupas Lapisan Kabel</h3>

                        <p>
                            Kupas bagian luar kabel dengan hati-hati
                            sehingga kabel inti terlihat.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">3</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Susun Kabel</h3>

                        <p>
                            Susun delapan kabel berdasarkan standar
                            T568A atau T568B.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">4</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Masukkan ke RJ45</h3>

                        <p>
                            Pastikan semua kabel masuk sampai ujung
                            konektor RJ45.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">5</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Crimping</h3>

                        <p>
                            Gunakan tang crimping untuk mengunci
                            konektor RJ45 pada kabel.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="step">

                    <div class="step-number">6</div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>Testing</h3>

                        <p>
                            Gunakan LAN Cable Tester untuk memastikan
                            urutan kabel sudah benar.
                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- ================= SHARING DATA ================= -->

        <section id="sharing">

            <div class="section-title">

                <h2>05. Sharing Data Peer-to-Peer</h2>

                <p>
                    Berbagi file antara dua komputer menggunakan kabel LAN.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="grid">

                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Alat yang Dibutuhkan</h3>

                    <ul>

                        <li>2 buah komputer/laptop</li>

                        <li
